  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 702.03 Designation of Prime Wetlands",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 702.03 Designation of Prime Wetlands. The local authority shall comply with all applicable procedures, including the notice requirements of RSA 482-A:15, I(a) and (b), in designating prime wetlands.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 700) #12807, eff 12-15-19",
